    "Rentals run April through October, weather permitting. FPDCC lists rowboats, kayaks, canoes, and fishing boats with a battery and trolling motor, with a two-hour minimum on the fishing boats. Like the other Cook County rental centers, Tampier follows a seasonal schedule — limited days in mid-April, daily service in May, and weekends after Labor Day. The boating center's number is 708-830-5194, and calling before you drive is the safest way to confirm hours on a given day.",
