    "Quick checklist for Tampier: confirm the day's hours by calling 708-830-5194, decide in advance whether you are renting or launching your own boat, bring a personal flotation device if you launch privately, and keep any motor electric. Rental craft, hours, and rates are all published on the official FPDCC boating page, which is the best place to check before you leave home.",
