    "Quick checklist for Maple Lake: check the operator page or send an email to confirm the day's hours, plan to rent rather than launch a private boat, bring sun protection and water, and be ready to sign the rental waiver. Adults 18 and older handle the paperwork, and a personal flotation device is required on the water. Rates and details are on the official pages.",
