    "This is a carry-in lake. LCFPD states that trailers are permitted only at Van Patten Woods among the four inland lakes, so you should plan to bring a boat that you can carry or roll by hand from the parking lot to the water. If you need to trailer your boat, Sterling Lake at Van Patten Woods is the Lake County option that allows it.",
