    "Quick checklist for Long Lake: save the boat-launch parking lot south of Rollins Road in your phone, bring approved flotation gear for everyone, carry or roll your boat to the water, keep any motor electric, and check the Lake County Forest Preserves site for hours or closures. If you need a trailer launch, use Sterling Lake at Van Patten Woods instead.",
